# --- Generated artifacts -----------------------------------------------------
# Figures are regenerated by the examples; only the four README heroes are
# committed (see IMPLEMENTATION_GUIDE.md §11).
#
# NOTE the trailing /* rather than /: git does not descend into an ignored
# DIRECTORY, so a `!` negation inside `docs/figures/` would never be reached.
# Ignoring the contents instead is what makes the exceptions below work.
docs/figures/*
!docs/figures/roa_van_der_pol.png
!docs/figures/roa_inverted_pendulum.png
!docs/figures/roa_unicycle_obstacle.png
!docs/figures/roa_consensus.png

# CSV written by the .jl demos and read by the notebooks; regenerated by CI
# before the notebooks run (see IMPLEMENTATION_GUIDE.md §9.1).
docs/figures/data/

# Benchmark scratch output
docs/benchmark_results/
*.log
